{"3568830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Duck Off!", "steam_appid": 3568830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duck Off</strong> is NOT your average parkour game. It’s a <strong>quack-fueled disaster simulator</strong> where you, a perfectly incompetent duck, attempt to climb your way to glory while everything and everyone actively tries to ruin your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play solo (if you enjoy suffering alone) or in multiplayer, where <strong>pure chaos</strong> unfolds. Every few minutes, the game randomly slaps players with a bizarre mode like <strong>Egg Fight </strong>(throw eggs at everything),<strong> Ice Mode </strong>(your feet are now a skating rink of regret), <strong>or Banana Mode</strong> (yes, bananas. Everywhere. Good luck! You will need it)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568830/extras/b1cff7230fe07d182d910fc34bb94efd.avif?t=1768665461\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568830/extras_big/b1cff7230fe07d182d910fc34bb94efd.avif?t=1768665461 width=800 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>NO checkpoints.</strong> You fall? That’s on you. You get shoved off by another duck? That’s on you too, but also kinda funny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed to <strong>make you suffer in the funniest way possible.</strong> You’ll laugh, you’ll cry, you’ll question why you’re still playing—<strong>but you’ll keep going, because DUCKS never quit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, if you love pain, betrayal, and ducks fight against each other—<strong>WELCOME to Duck Off!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568830/extras/21ead2272e9ad4ab05dbf4e40aa29c40.avif?t=1768665461\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568830/extras_big/21ead2272e9ad4ab05dbf4e40aa29c40.avif?t=1768665461 width=800 height=352 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duck Off</strong> is NOT your average parkour game. It’s a <strong>quack-fueled disaster simulator</strong> where you, a perfectly incompetent duck, attempt to climb your way to glory while everything and everyone actively tries to ruin your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play solo (if you enjoy suffering alone) or in multiplayer, where <strong>pure chaos</strong> unfolds. Every few minutes, the game randomly slaps players with a bizarre mode like <strong>Egg Fight </strong>(throw eggs at everything),<strong> Ice Mode </strong>(your feet are now a skating rink of regret), <strong>or Banana Mode</strong> (yes, bananas. Everywhere. Good luck! You will need it)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568830/extras/b1cff7230fe07d182d910fc34bb94efd.avif?t=1768665461\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568830/extras_big/b1cff7230fe07d182d910fc34bb94efd.avif?t=1768665461 width=800 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>NO checkpoints.</strong> You fall? That’s on you. You get shoved off by another duck? That’s on you too, but also kinda funny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed to <strong>make you suffer in the funniest way possible.</strong> You’ll laugh, you’ll cry, you’ll question why you’re still playing—<strong>but you’ll keep going, because DUCKS never quit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, if you love pain, betrayal, and ducks fight against each other—<strong>WELCOME to Duck Off!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568830/extras/21ead2272e9ad4ab05dbf4e40aa29c40.avif?t=1768665461\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568830/extras_big/21ead2272e9ad4ab05dbf4e40aa29c40.avif?t=1768665461 width=800 height=352 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Duck Off! is a parkour game with optional single or multiplayer modes. In multiplayer, random events like Egg Fight, Ice Mode, and Banana Mode add chaos and comedy. With no checkpoints, every fall is a fresh struggle and troll, try to make your way to victory in this unpredictable duck adventure!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568830/7c194231a2b4c20cd16c652a4ccf8cee83ed8287/header.jpg?t=1768665461", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568830/58d4e31340a45e4c2eb0ff9eccea141ce64487d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768665461", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568830/58d4e31340a45e4c2eb0ff9eccea141ce64487d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768665461", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-7100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>